  "reason": "Evidence: config_003 (pca_n2000, resnet50, multiprofile, transformer, weighted) achieves 0.573 accuracy at 6.61 GPU hrs, clearly outperforming config_002 (scgpt variant) at 0.494. This establishes pca_n2000 + transformer + multiprofile as a strong baseline. Uncertainty: the fusion strategy (weighted vs concat) has not been tested against the current best; it is a fundamental design choice affecting how RNA and image features are combined. This experiment (config_006) is a single-variable A/B test against config_003, changing only fusion from weighted to concat while keeping all other settings identical. It will clarify whether a more expressive fusion (concat + learned combination) can outperform the simpler weighted sum. Rationale: with 7 experiments remaining, a cheap (~6–7 GPU hrs, similar to config_003) targeted test reduces uncertainty about an important architectural axis at minimal cost, and the result will guide whether to invest remaining budget in concat-based or weighted-based multimodal configurations."
}

